# Sistem Kasir Backend API

Backend REST API untuk aplikasi kasir (Point of Sale/POS) yang dibangun menggunakan Express.js, Prisma ORM, Neon PostgreSQL, JWT Authentication, dan Zod Validation.

## Fitur

### Authentication

* Register User
* Login User
* JWT Authentication
* Role Based Access Control (Admin & Kasir)
* Get Current User (`/me`)

### Category Management

* Create Category
* Get All Categories
* Get Category By ID
* Update Category
* Delete Category

### Product Management

* Create Product
* Get All Products
* Get Product By ID
* Update Product
* Soft Delete Product
* Search Product
* Pagination Product

### Transaction Management

* Create Transaction (Checkout)
* Automatic Stock Reduction
* Transaction History
* Transaction Detail
* Transaction Filtering

## Tech Stack

* Node.js
* Express.js
* Prisma ORM
* PostgreSQL (NeonDB)
* JWT
* Zod
* Bcrypt

## Installation

Clone repository:

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
cd sistem_kasir
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

## Environment Variables

Buat file `.env`

```env
DATABASE_URL=your_neon_database_url
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret
PORT=3000
```

## Prisma Setup

Generate Prisma Client:

```bash
npx prisma generate
```

Push schema ke database:

```bash
npx prisma db push
```

## Run Application

Development:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Production:

```bash
npm start
```

## Authentication

### Register

POST `/api/auth/register`

Request Body:

```json
{
  "username": "adi",
  "email": "adi@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

### Login

POST `/api/auth/login`

Request Body:

```json
{
  "email": "adi@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

Response:

```json
{
  "token": "jwt_token"
}
```

Gunakan token pada setiap endpoint yang membutuhkan autentikasi:

```http
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

## Product Endpoint

### Get Products

```http
GET /api/products
```

### Search Product

```http
GET /api/products?search=indomie
```

### Pagination

```http
GET /api/products?page=1&limit=10
```

### Search + Pagination

```http
GET /api/products?search=indomie&page=1&limit=10
```

## Transaction Endpoint

### Create Transaction

POST `/api/transactions`

Request Body:

```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_ID",
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_ID",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
```

### Get All Transactions

```http
GET /api/transactions
```

### Filter By User

```http
GET /api/transactions?userId=USER_ID
```

### Filter By Date

```http
GET /api/transactions?date=2026-06-01
```

### Get Transaction Detail

```http
GET /api/transactions/:id
```

## Business Rules

### Product Soft Delete

Produk tidak benar-benar dihapus dari database. Sistem menggunakan soft delete dengan field:

```txt
deletedAt
```

Produk yang telah dihapus:

* Tidak muncul pada daftar produk
* Tidak dapat digunakan dalam transaksi
* Riwayat transaksi tetap aman

### Stock Management

Saat transaksi berhasil:

```txt
Stock = Stock - Quantity
```

Jika stok tidak mencukupi:

```txt
Transaction Failed
```

### Database Transaction

Checkout menggunakan Prisma Transaction:

```js
prisma.$transaction()
```

Sehingga seluruh proses checkout bersifat atomic:

* Simpan Transaction
* Simpan Transaction Item
* Kurangi Stock

Jika salah satu gagal maka seluruh proses dibatalkan.

